digest](https://www.aph.gov.au/Parliamentary_Business/Bills_Legislation/bd/bd2324a/24bd056): > *Part 2—Approval under Environment Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999 inserts proposed section 790E into the OPGGS Act to preserve the effect of the Offshore Petroleum and Greenhouse Gas Storage approvals made in accordance with the Endorsed Program under the EPBC Act, even where amendments to the OPGGS Act or prescribed regulations (such as the Environment Regulations) are inconsistent with aspects of the Endorsed Program.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-8918","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2024-05-16/25"}
